OL,3,AAbuse in media industry probably still
OL,4,Ahappening, minister warns in wake of
OL,5,ABrand case
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe added that since entering
OL,8,Fgovernment, "many people" from within
OL,9,Fthe industry had reached out to her "to
OL,10,Fallege that things have happened to
OL,11,Fthem".
OL,13,FBrand was found guilty of rape and
OL,14,Fsexual assault after a four-week trial,
OL,15,Ffollowing allegations from multiple
OL,16,Fwomen spanning the decade between 1999
OL,17,Fand 2009.
